      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 5.11,
          "en": "So let's work on the validation of this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.11,
          "end": 7.46,
          "en": "because at the moment we can submit it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.46,
          "end": 9.07,
          "en": "without entering anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.07,
          "end": 12.76,
          "en": "and that's of course not the idea behind this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.76,
          "end": 15.25,
          "en": "So in the coach form component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.25,
          "end": 16.36,
          "en": "we're fetching the input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.36,
          "end": 20.43,
          "en": "but now I wanna add an extra step when we submit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 22.35,
          "en": "I also want to validate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 26.62,
          "en": "and for that I'll add a separate method, validateForm simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.62,
          "end": 28.75,
          "en": "to split the logic in two methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.75,
          "end": 31.51,
          "en": "and not have one super long method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.51,
          "end": 35.2,
          "en": "and in submitForm right at the start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.2,
          "end": 38.433,
          "en": "I'll simply call this validateForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.5,
          "end": 41.903,
          "en": "so this new method which we're adding here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.19,
          "end": 45.96,
          "en": "Now in here I want to go through all the inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.96,
          "end": 49.15,
          "en": "and check whether they are valid or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.15,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "and I will add an overall new data property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 57.31,
          "en": "to this entire component, the formIsValid data component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.31,
          "end": 59.21,
          "en": "which initially is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.21,
          "end": 63.063,
          "en": "but which will be false as soon as one input is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 67.56,
          "en": "No actually I'll make form validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.56,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "even a bit more complex than just that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 74.51,
          "en": "I also want to manage the validity of every single element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.51,
          "end": 77.58,
          "en": "so that I can later re-highlight the elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.58,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "by coloring the label red for example, that were invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 85.1,
          "en": "Therefore, the other data which has managed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.1,
          "end": 89.12,
          "en": "is no longer just devalue of a certain property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.12,
          "end": 92.28999999999999,
          "en": "but instead here that will be an object now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.28999999999999,
          "end": 94.59,
          "en": "where I want to have a val key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.59,
          "end": 97.19,
          "en": "which holds the value the user entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.19,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "and a isValidKey which initially is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 104.343,
          "en": "which can become false if data input should be invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 108.37,
          "en": "So I'm going to replace my values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.37,
          "end": 110.593,
          "en": "with that new concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.97,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "Here val is null initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 118.69,
          "en": "and here it's an empty array initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.69,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "So now the data got a little bit more complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 123.55,
          "en": "and now we need to update v-model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.55,
          "end": 128.53,
          "en": "and bind this to firstName.val, lastName.val",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.53,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "and so on because now first name, last name, description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 136.1,
          "en": "actually hold objects where we have a val property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.1,
          "end": 138.98,
          "en": "which then holds to value that should be bound,.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.98,
          "end": 141.82999999999998,
          "en": "so that's why I'm updating my v-model bindings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.82999999999998,
          "end": 143.53300000000002,
          "en": "for all the inputs here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.42000000000002,
          "end": 148.22,
          "en": "including the checkboxes of course like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.6,
          "end": 154.6,
          "en": "and now with that in our validateForm method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 156.62,
          "en": "I will go through all these inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.62,
          "end": 157.94,
          "en": "have a look at each of them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.94,
          "end": 159.833,
          "en": "and see whether it's valid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.15,
          "end": 164.55,
          "en": "For this initially I'll set thisFormIsValid to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.55,
          "end": 167.64,
          "en": "in case it got invalid and therefore falls in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.64,
          "end": 169.79,
          "en": "between since the last validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.79,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "and then I'll go through all these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "The first one I'll check is the firstName.",
